# Example: test.wcn

## Schema

```
Game = PlayArea Ball [Team]/teams [Player]/players Scores
PlayArea = Rect
Rect = int/x int/y int/width int/height
Ball = Football | Rugbyball
Football = int/x int/y int/radius
Rugbyball = int/x int/y int/xrad int/yrad
Player = int/x int/y String/name
Team = String/name [Player]/players
Scores = int/home int/away
```

## Construction

```
$ps = [:Array/Player [10 10 "John"] [50 70 "Sally"]]

$scores = [:Scores 0 0]

[:Game 
  [:PlayArea [0 0 500 400]]
  [:Football 0 0 5]
  [:Array/Team ["West Ham" $ps] ["Crystal Palace" [:Array/Player [40 90 "Bob"]]]]
  $ps
  $scores
]
```
